Package: excelex
Title: Excel Workbook Extraction and Reconstruction Utilities
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: \
    person(given = "OpenCode", family = "Agent", role = c("aut", "cre"), \
           email = "opencode@example.com")
Description: Provides programmatic tooling to extract Excel workbooks into
    structured JSON and recreate Excel files from that JSON representation.
    Built on top of openxlsx2 and cli for informative progress reporting.
